துடவை","lemma":"துடவை","gloss":"field"}],"gloss":"field"},{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"gold"},{"surface":"போல்","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"சிறுதினை","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறுமை","gloss":"small"},{"text":"தினை","lemma":"தினை","gloss":"millet"}],"gloss":"small millet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கிளி","parts":[{"text":"கிளி","lemma":"கிளி","gloss":"parrot"}],"gloss":"parrot"},{"surface":"குறைத்து","parts":[{"text":"குறை","lemma":"குறை","gloss":"cut"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"hiatus/tense marker"},{"text":"து","lemma":"து","gloss":"past adverbial participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having cut"},{"surface":"உண்ட","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்ணுதல்","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"ட்","lemma":"ட்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"eaten"},{"surface":"கூழை","parts":[{"text":"கூழை","lemma":"கூழை","gloss":"cropped/short"}],"gloss":"cropped"},{"surface":"இருவி","parts":[{"text":"இருவி","lemma":"இருவி","gloss":"stubble of harvested millet"}],"gloss":"stubble"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெரும்பெயல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"},{"text":"பெயல்","lemma":"பெயல்","gloss":"rain"}],"gloss":"heavy rain"},{"surface":"உண்மையின்","parts":[{"text":"உண்மை","lemma":"உண்மை","gloss":"existence/presence"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"because of (causal suffix)"}],"gloss":"because of the presence"},{"surface":"இலை","parts":[{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இலை","gloss":"leaf"}],"gloss":"leaf"},{"surface":"ஒலித்தாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஒலித்து","lemma":"ஒலித்தல்","gloss":"having sprouted/grown thick"},{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"just like sprouting"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உரம்","parts":[{"text":"உரம்","lemma":"உரம்","gloss":"strength/willpower"}],"gloss":"strength"},{"surface":"செத்தும்","parts":[{"text":"செத்து","lemma":"சாதல்","gloss":"having died"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even/although"}],"gloss":"even though died"},{"surface":"உளெனே","parts":[{"text":"உளெனே","lemma":"உளெனே","gloss":"I am indeed alive"}],"gloss":"I am indeed alive","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நலம்","parts":[{"text":"நலம்","lemma":"நலம்","gloss":"beauty/goodness"}],"gloss":"beauty"},{"surface":"புதிது","parts":[{"text":"புதிது","lemma":"புதிது","gloss":"newly/freshly"}],"gloss":"newly"},{"surface":"உண்ட","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்ணுதல்","gloss":"eat/consume"},{"text":"ட்","lemma":"ட்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"consumed"},{"surface":"புலம்பினானே","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"loneliness/grief"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"inflectional increment"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"locative/instrumental suffix (in/by)"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"in the loneliness"}]}],"literal":"In the forest-cultivator's field, like gold, the small millet / having been cut and eaten by parrots, leaving cropped stubble, / because of the presence of heavy rain, sprouts leaves; like that, my / strength even though died, I am indeed alive, O friend, in my / loneliness after he newly consumed my beauty.","translation":"O friend! In the forest-cultivator's field, the gold-like small millet is cut and eaten by parrots, leaving behind cropped stubble. Yet, when heavy rains fall, that stubble sprouts leaves again. Just like that, even though my strength has died, I still remain alive in this loneliness, after he newly consumed my beauty.","modern":"தோழியே! தினைப்புனக் காவலாளியின் வயலில், பொன்னைப் போன்ற சிறு தினையைக் கிளிகள் கொத்தித் தின்ற பின் எஞ்சிய மொட்டையான தினைத்தாள்கள், பெருமழை பெய்யும்போது மீண்டும் தழைத்து இலைவிடுவது போல, என் அழகைப் புதிதாக நுகர்ந்துவிட்டு அவர் பிரிந்ததால் ஏற்பட்ட இந்தத் தனிமையிலும், என் மனவலிமை அழிந்துபோன பிறகும் நான் இன்னும் உயிரோடு இருக்கிறேன்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante in this Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape poem. The hero has departed after enjoying union with her, leaving her in deep grief, and the confidante is worried about her survival. The heroine compares her state to the cropped stubble of millet in a forest field. Parrots have eaten the golden millet, leaving only bare, cropped stalks, but when heavy rains fall, these seemingly dead stalks sprout fresh green leaves. The parrots eating the millet represents the hero enjoying the heroine's beauty, and the bare stubble represents her depleted state after his departure. The heavy rain represents the hope of the hero's return, which keeps her alive despite her lost strength.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.5,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.1,2.6],[2.6,2.7],[2.7,3.4],[3.4,4.3],[4.3,4.76],[4.88,5.5],[5.5,6.33],[6.33,6.33],[6.33,6.7],[6.7,7.2],[7.2,8.28],[8.28,8.55],[8.55,8.55],[8.55,8.82],[8.82,9.9]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.7],[1.7,1.8],[1.8,2.72],[2.72,2.72],[2.72,3.18],[3.18,4.1],[4.1,5.16],[5.16,5.7],[5.78,6.12],[6.12,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,6.2],[6.2,9.3],[9.3,9.3],[9.3,9.3],[9.3,9.3],[9.3,9.3]]},"sync":[[["புனவன்","forest cultivator"]],[["துடவை","field"],["பொன்","gold"]],[["பொன்","gold"],["போல்","like"]],[["சிறுதினை","small millet"]],[["கிளி","parrot"],["குறைத்து","having cut"]],[["குறைத்து","having cut"],["உண்ட","eaten"]],[["கூழை","cropped"]],[["இருவி","stubble"]],[["பெரும்பெயல்","heavy rain"]],[["பெரும்பெயல்","heavy rain"],["உண்மையின்","because of the presence"]],[["உண்மையின்","because of the presence"],["இலை","leaf"],["ஒலித்தாங்கு","just like sprouting"]],[["ஒலித்தாங்கு","just like sprouting"],["என்","my"]],[["உரம்","strength"]],[["செத்தும்","even though died"]],[["உளெனே","I am indeed alive"]],[["தோழி","O friend"],["என்","my"]],[["நலம்","beauty"],["புதிது","newly"]],[["புதிது","newly"],["உண்ட","consumed"]],[["புலம்பினானே","in the loneliness"]],[["புலம்பினானே","in the loneliness"]]]}